cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, cite it and record the exact data dates, symbols, source, and access date."
title: "ashare-l2: China A-Share Level-2 Market Data"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "submato"
    email: "lukalaoban@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/submato/ashare-l2"
url: "https://github.com/submato/ashare-l2"
abstract: >-
  An index, schema reference, and synthetic sample for historical China
  A-share Level-2 market data, including 10-level order book snapshots,
  order-by-order records, and tick-by-tick trades from the Shanghai and
  Shenzhen stock markets.
keywords:
  - A-share
  - China stock market
  - Level-2 market data
  - limit order book
  - order-by-order data
  - tick data
  - quantitative finance
  - market microstructure
  - Shanghai Stock Exchange
  - Shenzhen Stock Exchange
